  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the CSO LHRC. The Strategic Plan 2007-2012 sets out   the LHRC&apos;s vision of a just and equitable society. Focus on improving policies and legislation through strategic litigation and through     Parliamentary watch, strenghtening human rights monitoring and access to justice through 130 human rights monitors in all districts and 370 paralegals providing legal assistance to 10.000 citizens yearly.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till enskild org LHRC 2010-2012. LHRC bevakar och engagerar sig  i MR-fr&#xe5;gor &#xf6;ver hela landet genom MR-monitorer i alla 130 distrikt.  370 barfotajurister ger juridisk r&#xe5;dgivning &#xe5;t ca 10.000 personer     &#xe5;rligen. LHRC driver strategiska r&#xe4;ttsfall som f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndrar lagstiftning och st&#xe4;rker respekt f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. Parliamentary watch    och Election Watch &#xe4;r ocks&#xe5; aktiviteter inom strategiska planen.</narrative>
  </description>
